<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_features",
    "When you paste text containing multiple lines into the chat input, a confirmation dialog appears before sending."
  )}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_dialog_options}>{dgettext("help_features", "Dialog Options")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  <strong>{dgettext("help_features", "Send All")}</strong>
  {dgettext("help_features", "— Sends each line as a separate message.")}<br />
  <strong>
    {dgettext("help_features", "Cancel")}
  </strong>
  {dgettext("help_features", "— Cancels the paste operation.")}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_dialog_flood}>{dgettext("help_features", "Flood Warning")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_features",
    "Pasting more than 50 lines shows an additional flood warning. This prevents accidentally flooding a channel."
  )}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_terminal}>{dgettext("help_features", "How to Use It")}</.help_h4>
<ol>
  <li>{dgettext("help_features", "Copy several lines of text from anywhere.")}</li>
  <li>
    {dgettext(
      "help_features",
      "Click the chat input and paste with your usual keyboard shortcut or menu."
    )}
  </li>
  <li>
    {dgettext(
      "help_features",
      "The Paste Confirmation dialog shows how many lines will be sent."
    )}
  </li>
  <li>
    {dgettext(
      "help_features",
      "Click Send All to send them, or Cancel to drop the paste and return to the input."
    )}
  </li>
</ol>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_tab_control}>{dgettext("help_features", "How It Works")}</.help_h4>
<ul>
  <li>
    {dgettext(
      "help_features",
      "The dialog appears only when the pasted text has two or more lines with text. A single line is pasted into the input as usual."
    )}
  </li>
  <li>{dgettext("help_features", "Empty lines are removed before sending.")}</li>
  <li>
    {dgettext(
      "help_features",
      "The lines go to the active channel or PM in their original order, with a short pause between them."
    )}
  </li>
  <li>
    {dgettext(
      "help_features",
      "Each line is sent as plain text. A line that starts with a slash is not run as a command."
    )}
  </li>
</ul>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_document_alert}>{dgettext("help_features", "Rules and Limits")}</.help_h4>
<ul>
  <li>
    {dgettext(
      "help_features",
      "If you paste more than %{count} lines, the Send All button is disabled. Split the text into smaller parts.",
      count: "100"
    )}
  </li>
  <li>
    {dgettext(
      "help_features",
      "When the input is in Markdown mode, a multi-line paste goes into the input without the dialog, so you can send it as one message."
    )}
  </li>
  <li>
    {dgettext(
      "help_features",
      "The Status window does not accept text. Pasted lines sent there are rejected."
    )}
  </li>
</ul>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_link}>{dgettext("help_features", "See Also")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  <.help_link topic="feature-flood-protection">
    {dgettext("help_features", "Flood Protection")}
  </.help_link>
  ·
  <.help_link topic="feature-smart-input">{dgettext("help_features", "Smart Input")}</.help_link>
</p>
